{"seq":24,"slug":"incident-management-oncall","title":"事故管理与 on-call 工程","stage":"DONE","category":"cross-discipline","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/incident-management-oncall","rating":{"composite":3.9,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"事故管理与-on-call-工程\">事故管理与 on-call 工程</h1><p>凌晨三点,一条告警把你从睡梦中拽起来:支付成功率掉到了 60%。这一刻,你需要的不是&quot;如何设计高可用架构&quot;的长篇大论,而是一套能在十分钟内让你判断严重度、拉起战时频道、找到止血开关、并在事后真正学到东西的人与流程。这个 hub 讲的就是这件事——当系统已经出问题时,人该怎么组织、怎么响应、怎么轮班、怎么复盘。</p>\n<p>它和兄弟 hub 的边界很清楚。DevOps/SRE hub 关注的是如何把系统建得不容易坏:CI/CD、基础设施即代码、容量规划。站点可靠性(SRE)hub 关注的是可靠性这门工程学科的全貌。而本 hub 聚焦更窄、更人本的一段:事故发生后的响应,以及支撑响应的值班制度。换句话说,别处教你&quot;怎么少出事&quot;,这里教你&quot;出了事怎么办,以及怎么让团队在出事时不崩溃、出事后变更强&quot;。</p>\n<p>全 hub 由四条主线递进组成。第一条是<strong>事故管理基础</strong>:先界定什么是事故、如何用严重度分级、事故的生命周期长什么样;再补上衡量&quot;可靠到什么程度才需要响应&quot;的标尺——SLO 与错误预算;最后理清事故现场的角色分工与指挥体系。这是后面一切的词汇表与坐标系。</p>\n<p>第二条是 <strong>on-call 与响应</strong>,把基础落到日常运转:如何设计可持续的值班轮换而不把人榨干、如何设计告警让真正重要的事才把人吵醒、以及事故进行时如何分诊、止血、升级。这条线是 on-call 工程师每天实际经历的。</p>\n<p>第三条是<strong>复盘与学习</strong>,关注事故的&quot;下半场&quot;。无指责复盘奠定文化基调;根因与贡献因素分析提供拆解事故的方法论;改进项闭环确保复盘不止于一份没人读的文档,而是真正改变了系统。没有这条线,团队只会在同一个坑里反复跌倒。</p>\n<p>第四条是<strong>工程与文化</strong>,把前三条放大到组织层面:事故工具链与自动化降低响应的认知负担;混沌工程与演练在事故来临前主动制造可控的失败;on-call 文化与倦怠防治则正视这份工作对人的消耗,确保制度可持续。</p>\n<p>建议从基础读起,但四条线并非严格线性——一个成熟团队是同时在四个维度上演进的。读完你应当能回答:我们的严重度定义合理吗?告警吵不吵?复盘有没有变成行动?值班的人累不累?这些问题的答案,决定了一个团队在凌晨三点的从容程度。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"事故管理基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/incident-management-oncall/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-incident","title":"什么是事故:严重度与生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/incident-management-oncall/foundations/what-is-incident"},{"seq":2,"slug":"reliability-slo","title":"可靠性、SLO 与错误预算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/incident-management-oncall/foundations/reliability-slo"},{"seq":3,"slug":"incident-roles","title":"事故角色与指挥体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/incident-management-oncall/foundations/incident-roles"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"oncall","title":"on-call 与响应","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/incident-management-oncall/oncall","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"oncall-design","title":"值班轮换与可持续 on-call","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/incident-management-oncall/oncall/oncall-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"alerting-detection","title":"告警设计与检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/incident-management-oncall/oncall/alerting-detection"},{"seq":3,"slug":"triage-mitigation","title":"分诊、止血与升级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/incident-management-oncall/oncall/triage-mitigation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"learning","title":"复盘与学习","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/incident-management-oncall/learning","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"blameless-postmortem","title":"无指责复盘","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/incident-management-oncall/learning/blameless-postmortem"},{"seq":2,"slug":"root-cause-contributing","title":"根因与贡献因素分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/incident-management-oncall/learning/root-cause-contributing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"action-items-followthrough","title":"改进项与闭环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/incident-management-oncall/learning/action-items-followthrough"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"工程与文化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/incident-management-oncall/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"incident-tooling","title":"事故工具链与自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/incident-management-oncall/practice/incident-tooling"},{"seq":2,"slug":"chaos-game-days","title":"混沌工程与演练","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/incident-management-oncall/practice/chaos-game-days"},{"seq":3,"slug":"oncall-culture-burnout","title":"on-call 文化与倦怠防治","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/incident-management-oncall/practice/oncall-culture-burnout"}]}]